>> Combination := Lista nobo.

Combination ora: ['agregá-na-fin:'] hasi: { :el
	mes 
	buska: el, Nada? bèrdat: { mes agregá-na-fin: el. }.
}.

>> colours := Combination nobo.
colours
	agregá-na-fin: ['red'],
	agregá-na-fin: ['green'],
	agregá-na-fin: ['blue'],
	agregá-na-fin: ['red'].

Salida skirbi: colours, liña-nobo.
